WEBVTT

00:22:28.371 --> 00:22:31.373
Let's oppose the power of evil systems
at home and abroad,

00:22:31.397 --> 00:22:32.976
and let's focus on the positive.

00:22:33.000 --> 00:22:36.521
Advocate for respect of personal dignity,
for justice and peace,

00:22:36.545 --> 00:22:38.883
which sadly our administration
has not been doing.

00:22:38.907 --> 00:22:40.157
Thanks so much.

00:22:40.181 --> 00:22:43.290
(Applause)